# MAGIC <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-num">02</span><span class="sec-icon">🚀</span><h2>DevOps and CI/CD in one picture</h2></div><pre class="diagram"> feature branch ──► Pull request ──► CI: lint · unit tests · validate · deploy to TEST · integration tests
# MAGIC                                         │
# MAGIC  merge to main  ──────────────────────► CD: deploy the SAME code to PROD (service principal)</pre>
# MAGIC <div class="tbl"><table>
# MAGIC <thead>
# MAGIC <tr>
# MAGIC <th>Environment</th>
# MAGIC <th>Purpose</th>
# MAGIC <th>Typical isolation</th>
# MAGIC </tr>
# MAGIC </thead>
# MAGIC <tbody>
# MAGIC <tr>
# MAGIC <td><strong>Dev</strong></td>
# MAGIC <td>Each developer experiments safely</td>
# MAGIC <td>Personal schema / catalog, dev workspace</td>
# MAGIC </tr>
# MAGIC <tr>
# MAGIC <td><strong>Test / Staging</strong></td>
# MAGIC <td>Automated tests on realistic data</td>
# MAGIC <td>Separate catalog or workspace</td>
# MAGIC </tr>
# MAGIC <tr>
# MAGIC <td><strong>Prod</strong></td>
# MAGIC <td>Business-facing workloads</td>
# MAGIC <td>Separate workspace, runs as a <strong>service principal</strong></td>
# MAGIC </tr>
# MAGIC </tbody>
# MAGIC </table></div>
# MAGIC <p>Code and configuration are the <strong>same</strong> everywhere. Only <strong>parameters</strong> (catalog, paths, schedules) differ per environment.</p>
